        {
            "+content": "Longtime friends Riliu and Jowy are serving in the Highland Kingdom's Unicorn Youth Brigade when they are suddenly attacked by forces from the neighboring City States of Jowston—or so it appears at first. While escaping from the enemy forces, the two learn that this was actually a false flag operation—that Luca, Highland's bloodthirsty and sadistic crown prince, is starting a war for his own mysterious purposes. Now the two friends, separated, on the run, and within enemy territory, must find a way to survive and expose the conspiracy before thousands die in bloody conflict.",
            "+@gid": "1713267552",
            "+@type": "Plot Summary"
        },
